1
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:58,240
Sorry about that, brothers.

2
00:00:58,920 --> 00:01:00,119
That guy Bro Liu,

3
00:01:00,439 --> 00:01:02,799
insisted you two were suspicious

4
00:01:02,799 --> 00:01:04,560
and took it upon himself to interrogate you.

5
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:06,000
As you know,

6
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,640
the higher-ups are putting a lot of pressure on us.

7
00:01:08,120 --> 00:01:09,480
I have to give them an answer.

8
00:01:09,879 --> 00:01:10,680
Bro Snake.

9
00:01:11,719 --> 00:01:12,519
It's fine.

10
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:14,680
I just joined the trade, after all.

11
00:01:15,439 --> 00:01:16,840
It's normal that Bro Liu doesn't trust me.

12
00:01:16,879 --> 00:01:17,680
You...

13
00:01:18,120 --> 00:01:19,840
are just too honest.

14
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:21,280
Let me tell you,

15
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:22,959
in our line of work,

16
00:01:23,439 --> 00:01:26,120
the biggest taboo is kindness.

17
00:01:28,719 --> 00:01:30,519
Cut the bullshit.

18
00:01:32,159 --> 00:01:33,480
You messed us up like this,

19
00:01:34,719 --> 00:01:36,120
so you owe us an explanation.

20
00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:37,480
I'll drag Bro Liu over right now

21
00:01:37,480 --> 00:01:38,920
and beat him up, alright?

22
00:01:39,079 --> 00:01:40,000
No need.

23
00:01:41,480 --> 00:01:42,879
I'll get payback on Bro Liu.

24
00:01:43,959 --> 00:01:45,760
You only need to do one thing right now.

25
00:01:46,079 --> 00:01:46,959
Speak.

26
00:01:46,959 --> 00:01:47,560
More money.

27
00:01:48,519 --> 00:01:49,840
Sure.

28
00:01:50,159 --> 00:01:51,560
But with things the way they are,

29
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:53,319
how can I afford to pay you?

30
00:01:53,719 --> 00:01:56,159
So hurry up and get to work.

31
00:01:56,239 --> 00:01:57,319
Once the company makes money,

32
00:01:57,719 --> 00:01:59,120
you'll be the first ones I pay.

33
00:01:59,120 --> 00:01:59,920
Alright?

34
00:02:00,439 --> 00:02:01,239
Deal.

35
00:02:01,959 --> 00:02:02,760
Bro Snake.

36
00:02:03,519 --> 00:02:04,359
I'll get right on it.

37
00:02:08,759 --> 00:02:09,639
What are you staring at?

38
00:02:09,639 --> 00:02:10,879
Call a doctor!

39
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:11,599
Right away!

40
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:14,039
Bro Snake.

41
00:02:17,759 --> 00:02:18,560
You two,

42
00:02:18,759 --> 00:02:20,080
for the next month,

43
00:02:20,080 --> 00:02:21,960
neither of you can leave without permission.

44
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:23,039
Got it?

45
00:02:23,039 --> 00:02:23,719
As for the performance,

46
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:25,159
I'm counting on you.

47
00:02:26,719 --> 00:02:27,439
Let's go.

48
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:33,439
Are you okay?

49
00:02:37,759 --> 00:02:39,319
You scared me to death.

50
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:52,960
Sir.

51
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:54,439
Let me explain.

52
00:02:54,680 --> 00:02:56,439
It was really an accident this time.

53
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:01,759
Do you know how much I lost this time?

54
00:03:01,759 --> 00:03:05,240
Personnel, space, and equipment combined cost millions.

55
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:07,000
We took strict precautions.

56
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:08,919
But I really don't know what went wrong.

57
00:03:08,919 --> 00:03:10,280
On your scam list,

58
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:12,319
a college student died, did you know?

59
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:14,240
I didn't know.

60
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:15,960
But what does that matter?

61
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:17,120
It has alerted the police.

62
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:19,360
They have a one-month deadline to crack the case.

63
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:21,159
You better stay sharp from now on.

64
00:03:22,599 --> 00:03:23,840
Yes, understood, Sir.

65
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:25,159
I'll find you a new place.

66
00:03:25,919 --> 00:03:27,759
Put together a new team for me.

67
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:29,360
When finding people this time,

68
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:31,360
you must keep your eyes wide open.

69
00:03:32,120 --> 00:03:33,080
Yes, Sir.

70
00:03:33,280 --> 00:03:34,000
Get lost.

71
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,400
Bro Snake,

72
00:03:45,159 --> 00:03:46,039
what happened?

73
00:03:47,319 --> 00:03:48,639
Look at this mess.

74
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:50,120
Did you just get chewed out?

75
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:54,039
Bro Snake,

76
00:03:54,039 --> 00:03:56,240
there's something I don't know if I should say.

77
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:57,639
Speak.

78
00:03:58,360 --> 00:04:00,560
I just feel that since you're so capable,

79
00:04:00,879 --> 00:04:02,759
there's no need to keep working for others.

80
00:04:03,159 --> 00:04:04,560
All that money,

81
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:05,759
we could be pocketing it ourselves.

82
00:04:05,879 --> 00:04:06,560
Wouldn't that be nice?

83
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:08,080
Keep going.

84
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:10,680
We could totally form a new team

85
00:04:10,680 --> 00:04:11,639
and pull off a big job.

86
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:13,280
Make enough money all at once.

87
00:04:14,039 --> 00:04:15,080
Don't worry, Bro Snake.

88
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:15,719
As for the people,

89
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:16,720
I'll get them for you.

90
00:04:16,759 --> 00:04:18,319
The new team will be set up in no time.

91
00:04:20,519 --> 00:04:21,519
Okay.

92
00:04:21,519 --> 00:04:22,279
I'll leave it to you.

93
00:04:23,319 --> 00:04:24,839
Find some sharp ones this time.

94
00:04:24,839 --> 00:04:25,759
Don't worry.

95
00:04:26,199 --> 00:04:27,040
Bro Snake,

96
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:27,800
there's one more thing.

97
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:29,079
About this Li Wen,

98
00:04:29,079 --> 00:04:30,120
he does have the skills,

99
00:04:30,360 --> 00:04:32,079
but he has one major flaw.

100
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:32,920
What?

101
00:04:33,279 --> 00:04:34,920
Too soft-hearted.

102
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:36,560
We need to find him a task to toughen him up.

103
00:04:43,519 --> 00:04:44,160
I won't do it again!

104
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:45,040
Pull me up!

105
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:46,000
I'll never look again!

106
00:04:46,360 --> 00:04:48,120
I'm sorry! I won't do it again!

107
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:50,120
Miss, please plead for me!

108
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,319
I'll never look at you again!

109
00:04:51,319 --> 00:04:52,560
Pull me up!

110
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:55,120
I won't do it again! It's too scary down here!

111
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:57,759
You like to look, huh?

112
00:04:58,560 --> 00:05:00,040
I'll let you look all you want!

113
00:05:52,920 --> 00:05:53,720
Li Wen.

114
00:06:01,319 --> 00:06:02,120
Bro Snake.

115
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:04,000
I just took some meds.

116
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:05,399
I'm a bit groggy.

117
00:06:05,680 --> 00:06:06,480
What the hell?

118
00:06:07,199 --> 00:06:08,519
Feeling guilty?

119
00:06:09,759 --> 00:06:10,560
Nothing like that.

120
00:06:11,839 --> 00:06:12,839
Good.

121
00:06:12,839 --> 00:06:14,000
I've got a new job for you.

122
00:06:14,839 --> 00:06:16,959
A big job so soon?

123
00:06:17,319 --> 00:06:18,439
In this line of work,

124
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:20,000
getting intel is what you do best.

125
00:06:20,759 --> 00:06:22,720
That dead college girl...

126
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:25,600
Her mother received a lot of donations.

127
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:27,439
I heard it's hundreds of thousands.

128
00:06:28,399 --> 00:06:29,600
I'm giving this one to you.

129
00:06:30,519 --> 00:06:31,639
Interested?

130
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:48,079
You.

131
00:06:48,439 --> 00:06:49,519
Sit next to me and help.

132
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:50,920
Me?

133
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:51,639
Yes, you.

134
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:54,040
Didn't Bro Snake send you to help?

135
00:06:54,639 --> 00:06:55,839
If you screw this up,

136
00:06:55,959 --> 00:06:57,199
watch your ears.

137
00:06:58,720 --> 00:06:59,519
I'll give you a code.

138
00:07:00,079 --> 00:07:00,879
Monitor it for me.

139
00:07:01,279 --> 00:07:02,600
Follow my instructions.

140
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:03,279
Got it?

141
00:07:04,639 --> 00:07:05,439
Okay.

142
00:07:17,519 --> 00:07:19,360
Drink your medicine, dear.

143
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:20,800
Dear...

144
00:07:21,079 --> 00:07:22,959
I really can't drink anymore.

145
00:07:23,519 --> 00:07:25,439
I've been a burden to you.

146
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:30,040
Dear...

147
00:07:30,519 --> 00:07:31,800
Don't you think I'm hurting too?

148
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,279
But for Shanshan's sake,

149
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:36,120
we both have to live on.

150
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:38,040
It's the only way to honor

151
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:39,759
Shanshan's spirit in heaven.

152
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:41,839
Come on, drink it.

153
00:07:45,439 --> 00:07:47,480
There are still many good people in this world.

154
00:07:48,519 --> 00:07:51,680
Kind people online are already donating to us.

155
00:07:51,879 --> 00:07:53,079
We've already received a portion of it.

156
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:54,759
Once the money comes in,

157
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:56,560
you can get the surgery.

158
00:07:58,519 --> 00:07:59,319
Come on, drink up.

159
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:00,959
Please, drink it.

160
00:08:14,759 --> 00:08:16,759
I have to handle this job myself.

161
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:31,879
Hello?

162
00:08:31,879 --> 00:08:32,840
Hello.

163
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:35,120
Is this Huang Shanshan's mother?

164
00:08:35,120 --> 00:08:36,000
Speaking.

165
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:39,240
Regarding the charity donations for your husband, Mr. Huang Dashan,

166
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:40,639
the total has reached 400,000.

167
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:43,120
400,000 is enough.

168
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:45,360
No need for more donations.

169
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:47,159
It's enough.

170
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:48,000
Yes.

171
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:50,399
The public

172
00:08:50,399 --> 00:08:51,840
cares deeply about your husband's condition,

173
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:54,360
so the charity funds were raised quickly.

174
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:56,240
However, the final 80,000

175
00:08:56,240 --> 00:08:57,799
has not cleared yet.

176
00:08:57,799 --> 00:09:00,639
We will need about a month to process it.

177
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:02,679
Why?

178
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:06,399
My old man's illness can't wait a month.

179
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:07,440
The situation is,

180
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:09,759
because our backend is undergoing an upgrade,

181
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:11,519
some functions are unavailable.

182
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:13,440
But we can make an exception

183
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:15,200
and arrange a special channel for you.

184
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:16,799
You need to download an APP.

185
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:18,759
I will send you a link right now.

186
00:09:25,759 --> 00:09:27,360
I've opened it,

187
00:09:28,159 --> 00:09:29,759
but I don't understand it.

188
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:31,159
You do not need to, ma'am.

189
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:32,399
It is very simple.

190
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:34,399
Just follow my instructions.

191
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:36,159
Oh, okay.

192
00:09:38,799 --> 00:09:40,600
Immediately plant a Trojan in her phone

193
00:09:40,679 --> 00:09:42,080
to prevent police tracking.

194
00:09:42,159 --> 00:09:42,759
Understood.

195
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:55,879
Captain.

196
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:57,480
The Informant sent some numbers.

197
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:58,279
But I don't understand them.

198
00:10:00,399 --> 00:10:01,679
The bold text is a phone number.

199
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:03,120
Identify the owner immediately.

200
00:10:03,120 --> 00:10:03,639
Yes, sir.

201
00:10:05,720 --> 00:10:06,600
Check this for me.

202
00:10:08,919 --> 00:10:11,360
Officer, I've downloaded it.

203
00:10:11,639 --> 00:10:13,600
Good. Just click confirm.

204
00:10:14,039 --> 00:10:15,639
Found it. It's Huang Shanshan's mother.

205
00:10:16,519 --> 00:10:17,600
Call her immediately to intercept it.

206
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:18,039
Yes, sir.

207
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:25,279
I've opened the app.

208
00:10:25,879 --> 00:10:26,799
But I'm a bit clumsy.

209
00:10:26,799 --> 00:10:27,639
I can't figure it out.

210
00:10:27,879 --> 00:10:29,360
Do not worry, Mrs. Huang.

211
00:10:29,919 --> 00:10:31,440
Just enter your bank card number

212
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:33,159
and your ID number.

213
00:10:33,320 --> 00:10:34,320
Oh, okay.

214
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:38,759
I can't get through.

215
00:10:38,759 --> 00:10:39,919
Her phone is being controlled.

216
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:41,080
Da Liu.

217
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:42,799
Tell the local station to head there immediately.

218
00:10:42,879 --> 00:10:43,399
Xiao Lin.

219
00:10:43,399 --> 00:10:43,799
Xiao Hui.

220
00:10:43,799 --> 00:10:44,320
Follow me.

221
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:44,840
Yes, sir.

222
00:10:46,639 --> 00:10:48,720
Officer, I've entered them.

223
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:50,240
I received a number.

224
00:10:50,639 --> 00:10:52,440
That is a six-digit verification code.

225
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:53,720
Just read it to me.

226
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:54,960
Oh, okay.

227
00:10:55,039 --> 00:10:56,200
Dear.

228
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:58,000
Who are you talking to?

229
00:10:58,399 --> 00:10:59,799
Someone from the charity center.

230
00:10:59,799 --> 00:11:01,000
They're checking up on us.

231
00:11:02,720 --> 00:11:03,559
Then make sure to properly

232
00:11:03,559 --> 00:11:04,759
thank them.

233
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:10,000
Four.

234
00:11:10,759 --> 00:11:11,720
Six.

235
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:13,600
Sun Ming.

236
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:14,480
Hurry up.

237
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:26,240
Seven.

238
00:11:32,159 --> 00:11:32,960
Six.

239
00:11:35,879 --> 00:11:36,840
Is anybody there?

240
00:11:37,799 --> 00:11:38,759
Hello?

241
00:11:38,759 --> 00:11:39,440
Xiao Lin, come with me.

242
00:11:46,279 --> 00:11:47,120
Four.

243
00:11:52,879 --> 00:11:53,679
Two.

244
00:11:54,039 --> 00:11:55,000
Ma'am, open the door!

245
00:11:55,679 --> 00:11:56,399
I'm the police!

246
00:11:56,399 --> 00:11:57,159
Open up, quickly!

247
00:11:57,519 --> 00:11:58,120
Officer.

248
00:11:58,120 --> 00:11:59,440
What are you doing?

249
00:12:00,799 --> 00:12:02,120
Ma'am, you're being scammed.

250
00:12:02,399 --> 00:12:03,799
They're from the charity center.

251
00:12:04,279 --> 00:12:05,519
They're helping us.

252
00:12:05,519 --> 00:12:06,519
No, they aren't.

253
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:11,600
Officer Sun, right?

254
00:12:12,080 --> 00:12:14,799
Must've felt great raiding my place last time.

255
00:12:15,240 --> 00:12:17,159
I'm here to recover some losses this time.

256
00:12:17,399 --> 00:12:18,879
Not too much to ask, right?

257
00:12:19,320 --> 00:12:20,279
No!

258
00:12:21,159 --> 00:12:23,440
This is our lifesaving money!

259
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:26,519
Ma'am, open the bank transfer page for me quickly.

260
00:12:29,399 --> 00:12:31,039
Stop wasting time.

261
00:12:31,240 --> 00:12:32,879
It's too late.

262
00:12:37,240 --> 00:12:39,360
I'm so useless.

263
00:12:40,519 --> 00:12:42,799
First, I caused my daughter's death.

264
00:12:45,080 --> 00:12:48,679
And now I'm getting my old man killed too.

265
00:12:54,519 --> 00:12:55,720
We got the money!

266
00:12:56,159 --> 00:12:58,240
We're rich!

267
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:00,720
Li Wen.

268
00:13:00,960 --> 00:13:02,840
Well done.

269
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:06,519
Let's sit back and count our cash.
